:''This article is about the [[Cat Units|Cat Unit]]. For the [[Enemy Units|Enemy unit]], see [[Li'l Eraser Cat (Enemy)]]''
'''Li'l Tank Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Lucky Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]] grants [[Immune to Freeze|Freeze Immunity]] and increases health and attack power. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]].

