==Trivia==
*In the Taiwanese version, Li'l Eraser Cat doesn't have the word "NEKO" on its body. The same also applies to [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]].
*Even though Li'l Eraser Cat's description says it has the same attack power as always, its [[True Form]] actually increases its attack power.
*Li'l Tank Cat's Dodge Talent description states 'Unlocks the "Immune to Zombies" ability.<br>Level up to increase length of time Immune!'.
*Li'l Tank Cat is tied with [[Li'l Clops Cat Egg (Special Cat)|Li'l Clops Cat Egg]], [[:Category:Ancient Eggs|Ancient Eggs]], [[Wafer Cat (Special Cat)|Wafer Cat]] and [[PAC-MAN (Special Cat)|PAC-MAN]] for the lowest standing range of any Cat Unit in the game (barring the unobtainable [[Cheetah Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Cheetah Cat]]).

